{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは、渡辺です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/04/05/6133941/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんお花見は行かれましたか？\n最近お花見がしたくてたまりません\n桜が散らないうちに(>_<)\nレジャーシート敷いてお弁当広げて\nたくさん食べたあとは遊んだり\nゆったりくつろいだり、、、♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてじょしらく弐！\nチームく の\n波浪浮亭 木胡桃 を演じます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"役が決まるまでドキドキで、\nきぐちゃんをやりたかったので\n嬉しかったです(^ ^)\nきっときぐちゃんが5役の中では\n1番しっくり来るんじゃないかな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この間、きぐちゃんのかつらを\nかぶったら皆にいたずらっ子\nみたいと言われました、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"( ^ω^ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーライブとじょしらく\n両方とも良いもの作れるように\n頑張ります"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんぜひ観に来てくださいね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"同じチームの\nちはるさん、にゃん、玲香さん、琴子\n宜しくお願いします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんな5人になるんだろう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎質問返し◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・みり愛が注目している芸人さんはいますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→メンバーに楽屋でのテンションが\n似てると言われる、渡辺直美さん。\nさらにまた似てると言われる、横澤夏子さん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このお二人大好きです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・みり愛は占いとか信じますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→信じちゃいます(>_<)\nラッキーカラーとか合わせちゃう笑〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・みり愛はベッド、ぬいぐるみで\n溢れていそうなイメージだけど\nそのぬいぐるみを寝ている間\n蹴飛ばしてそうなイメージ笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→小さい頃に買ったぬいぐるみが\n捨てられずにたくさんあります...\n蹴飛ばすなんて、、そんな( ^ω^ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(毎朝マーマが片付けています)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・みり愛の不等号の歌のパートは\nどこですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→♪ため息を肩でついた〜\n♪悲しくない訳じゃなく泣き顔は嫌い〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・みり愛は要らないものはひょいひょい\n捨ててしまうタイプですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→捨てられない派です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・ブレザーとセーラー服どっちが好き？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→セーラー服好きですねえ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/04/05/6133941/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪の毛すんばらしく伸びました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも逆質問という名前で\n私から皆さんに質問をしていたのですが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「逆質問じゃなくてみり愛からの質問コーナーとかみたいに名前を変えてみたら？」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"という意見をいただいたので\n名前を募集したいと思います(^ ^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで前回の逆質問(仮)は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分の中でこれだけは捨てられない！\nという物は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でした\n多かった順に紹介していきます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1位 乃木坂のグッズ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2位 手紙"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3位 小さい頃に貰ったぬいぐるみ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4位 卒業アルバム"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5位 誕生日プレゼント"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でした〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回の逆質問(仮)は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂の全作の中で好きは衣装は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントお待ちしております(^ ^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎告知◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・4月12日 NOGIBINGO!6"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・4月22日 BRODY"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/04/05/6133941/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また見てね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みり愛"}],"source":"archive"}